  "storyPlan": {
    "premise": "Why I started building TikMaker. There was chaos in my head: it’s hard to understand how to analyse successful videos, it takes a lot of time and some kind of structure. I wanted my videos to have one brand and one library, all videos easy to edit by hand, a place to write the script, and AI helping me there. I also wanted to learn to build AI agents, so I thought the most useful place is to put one right inside TikMaker. So it’s a personal video, but it also shows what TikMaker is."
  },
